      "content": "i mean i don't really have insurance right now so going to a doctor is gonna be super expensive. it's just a tiny little line and it doesn't even hurt that much. can i just take some ibuprofen and keep applying the ointment for another day or two to see if it goes away? seems like i can handle it.",
